  "description": "Memory-first, SQL-free embedded database engine for .NET, designed for Blazor WebAssembly: live rows in managed memory, source-generated serializers and indexes, atomic transactions, and WAL/snapshot persistence with no SQL and no JS interop on the read path. Includes the source generator for [BlazeDbTable] types and the browser storage backends: OPFS and IndexedDB, Web Locks single-writer election, a WebCrypto AES-GCM cipher, and cross-tab sync between a writer tab and read-only replicas.",
